+// SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
+// Replacements for AVX2, FMA and BMI2 instructions built from what the PS4's Jaguar CPU has
+// (SSE4.2, AVX, BMI1, F16C). See jaguarCompat.h.
